Lafa

This distribution includes model weights derived from the Qwen model family.
Qwen2.5 and Qwen3 model repositories identify their license as Apache-2.0.
Upstream models:
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B-Base

Lafa adds time conditioning, flow objectives and decoding, and learned time schedules.
Transformers and PyTorch are external dependencies and retain their own licenses.
